{
  "name": "RAG - Workflow 3 - Agente de búsqueda y consulta",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "height": 330,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Workflow 3: Agente RAG (buscar y preguntar)\n\nAtiende las acciones `buscar` y `consultar` de la página (el Workflow 2 responde 501 a esas acciones).\n\n**Antes de activar:**\n1. Credencial Header Auth \"Gemini API Key\": header `x-goog-api-key` con tu clave de Google AI Studio (aistudio.google.com).\n2. Credencial Header Auth \"Qdrant API key\": header `api-key` con la clave de Qdrant Cloud. Si usas Qdrant local sin clave, créala con cualquier valor (Qdrant la ignora).\n3. En 'Leer sesiones' poner el mismo ID de la hoja que el Workflow 2.\n4. En 'Buscar en Qdrant' y 'Buscar fragmentos' poner la URL de tu Qdrant y verificar que la colección sea la misma del Workflow 1 (documentos_rag).\n5. Activar y copiar la URL de producción (`/webhook/agente-rag`) en la página: Configurar conexión → URL del agente RAG.\n\nValida el token de sesión igual que el Workflow 2 (pestaña Sesiones, expiración incluida)."
      },
      "id": "a00",
      "name": "Instrucciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "agente-rag",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "a01",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "b7e4d2a9-5c1f-4e8b-8a3d-6f2c9e1b4a70"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ID_DE_LA_HOJA_DE_CALCULO",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sesiones",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a02",
      "name": "Leer sesiones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "executeOnce": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const w=$('Webhook').first().json;\nconst b=w.body||{};\nconst tk=(w.headers.authorization||'').replace(/^Bearer\\s+/i,'');\nconst s=$('Leer sesiones').all().map(i=>i.json).find(x=>x.token&&x.token===tk&&new Date(x.expira)>new Date());\nconst accion=String(b.accion||'');\nconst error=s?'':'Sesión no válida o vencida. Inicia sesión de nuevo.';\nreturn [{json:{valido:!!s,error,usuario:s?s.usuario:'',rol:s?s.rol:'',accion,q:String(b.q||'').trim(),pregunta:String(b.pregunta||'').trim(),repo:String(b.repo||'').trim(),sesion:b.sesion||''}}];"
      },
      "id": "a03",
      "name": "Validar sesión",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a041",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valido }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a04",
      "name": "¿Sesión válida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { error: $json.error || 'Sesión no válida' } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 401
        }
      },
      "id": "a05",
      "name": "Responder sesión inválida",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        960,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "buscar",
              "renameOutput": true,
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "a061",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.accion }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "rightValue": "buscar"
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "consultar",
              "renameOutput": true,
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "a062",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.accion }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "rightValue": "consultar"
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "id": "a06",
      "name": "Acción",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { error: 'Acción no disponible. Usa buscar o consultar.' } }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 501
        }
      },
      "id": "a07",
      "name": "Acción no disponible",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-embedding-001:embedContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model:'models/gemini-embedding-001', content:{ parts:[{ text: $('Validar sesión').first().json.q }] } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a08",
      "name": "Embedir consulta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://TU-URL-DE-QDRANT:6333/collections/documentos_rag/points/search",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify(Object.assign({ vector: $json.embedding.values, limit: 5, with_payload: true }, $('Validar sesión').first().json.repo ? { filter: { must: [ { key: 'metadata.repo', match: { value: $('Validar sesión').first().json.repo } } ] } } : {})) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a09",
      "name": "Buscar en Qdrant",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const hits=Array.isArray($json.result)?$json.result:[];\nconst resultados=hits.map(h=>({\n  archivo:(h.payload&&h.payload.metadata&&h.payload.metadata.archivo)||'Documento',\n  fragmento:String((h.payload&&h.payload.text)||'').slice(0,600),\n  score:typeof h.score==='number'?Math.round(h.score*1000)/1000:null\n}));\nreturn [{json:{resultados}}];"
      },
      "id": "a10",
      "name": "Formatear resultados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a11",
      "name": "Responder resultados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-embedding-001:embedContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model:'models/gemini-embedding-001', content:{ parts:[{ text: $('Validar sesión').first().json.pregunta }] } }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a12",
      "name": "Embedir pregunta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        720
